id=gxr-xrcam
name=Galaxy XR Camera Debug WebStream
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=BreadDoesStuff
description=Streams all 13 physical cameras (2x RGB passthrough, 6x tracking, 4x eye tracking, 1x dToF) of the Samsung Galaxy XR as MJPEG over HTTP on port 8080. Uses the QVR camera service; no system files modified.
